<title>USA: Care Group's Jung resigns as CEO.</title>
<headline>Care Group's Jung resigns as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE SUCCESS, N.Y. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Care Group Inc said chief executive Richard Jung has decided to resign and pursue other business interests.</p>
<p>The company said it has implemented an operating committee to undertake Jung's primary executive duties until such time as the company selects a new CEO.</p>
</text>
